in today's video we'll be explaining all  female titans in attack on titan we will  start with annie leonhardt and in the  later parts of the video we will be  showing you some of the female titans  that you probably didn't know about the  female titan is not so special if  compared to other titan shifters but  thanks to andy leonhardt and her  incredible martial arts skills it's  actually one of the strongest titans in  the anime on top of that the abilities  such as the scream the hardening as well  as the power to crystallize her human  form proved to be very effective and  useful in titan fights annie was  deported to an internment zone and later  adopted by mr leonhardt because her  blood test revealed that she was the  subject of ymir at some point in her  childhood annie joined the merlin  military as a warrior candidate meeting  comrades such as bertolt hoover reiner  braun and marcel galliard annie was  praised as impeccable for her fighting  abilities and was later chosen as one of  seven promising candidates to inherit  the power of the titans she was later  granted the power of the female titan in  accordance with her stellar combat  skills annie was selected as one of the  four warriors to carry out the paradise  island mission along with the jaw  armored and colossus titans the  objective of the mission was to attack  the aldians living in the walls and lure  out and steal the founding titan after  infiltrating the walls she joins the  104th training corps where she proves to  be a formidable fighter even in her  human form she ranks fourth among her  entire training class while posing as a  recruit on paradise island's city  defenses roughly on par with mikasa  annie is especially adept at taking down  larger stronger opponents either in  hand-to-hand combat or using the  vertical maneuvering equipment she is  able to trigger her transformation by  self-inducing pain usually by a hidden  blade concealed in a ring or by simply  biting her hand thanks to her hard  training annie is stronger and faster  than most titan shifters and is able to  maintain the form much longer before  reverting to her human state from  exhaustion on top of her extraordinary  endurance speed and strength annie  possesses the fast healing ability that  she can focus on specific parts of her  damaged body while other titans need to  slowly heal all their body parts  simultaneously one of her most useful  abilities is to crystallize her entire  body into a rock hard form so that she  can avoid being taken by the enemies  when aaron is revealed as the titan and  57th expedition of the survey corps  started annie uses her female titan form  to lead a group of titans to capture  aaron wiping out the majority of the  spotters on the right side of the survey  core's formation annie is eventually  lured into a trap in which her movements  are halted by the special  titan-restraining weapon she manages to  cover her nape with her hands forcing  irwin and his soldiers to search for  ways to destroy them constant  provocations by levi cause her to let  out a roar that causes multiple titans  to converge on her position the titans  devour her female titan form allowing  annie to escape from her titan  undetected catching up to aaron she  kills levi's entire squad and forces  aaron to transform the two begin a  brutal fight using hand-to-hand combat  techniques at the end of which annie  succeeds in defeating aaron's titan form  by decapitating it she captures aaron  inside the mouth of her female titan and  begins to flee but is later stopped by  levi sometime later she is discovered as  a female titan by armin who tries to  lure her into a trap accepting that she  has been found out annie smiles in  relief and transforms into her female  titan form killing those restraining her  in the process aaron then transforms  into his titan form to face her during  their battle they destroy everything  that comes in their way annie then takes  flight towards walshina but ends up  captured by the survey corps  apart from andy steiten we barely got to  learn anything about the other female  titans in history in the chapter about  king fritz and ymir's past we learned  about the first ever nine titan shifters  the first ever female titan actually  looked very similar to annie's female  titan the only clear difference is long  brown hair our next encounter with past  female titan shifters happened in the  middle of the battle of heaven and earth  when aaron uses his founding titan  abilities to bring all past titan  shifters back to life the first one we  see and surely one of the scariest  titans in the entire show is the  completely red female titan with long  dark hair this one looks very scary and  its skin kinda reminds me of a colossal  titan the next female titan we see  engages in the battle with reiner's  armored titan there's nothing special  about this one it looks very similar to  annie's version the only difference is  brown hair we also get to see what  appears to be the first ever female  titan battling tom savers beast titan a  few more female titans appear during  this battle but they are very low  quality so we weren't able to draw them  now that you know about all the female  titans in the show click on this video  to learn more about all attack titans in  attack on titan
 

